# Prettier only reads the `.gitignore` next to the working directory, not
# nested ones, so `src-tauri/.gitignore` does not reach it. Re-state the
# generated paths here: `gen/schemas` is rewritten by Tauri on every build and
# `target/` is Cargo's output — formatting either would be undone immediately.
src-tauri/gen/
src-tauri/target/
